  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <style=title><color=#a8e7eb><size=24>50LINES</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#a8e7eb>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><color=#6be740><size=34>WILD</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 'Appears on reels <b>2</b>, <b>3</b>, <b>4</b> and <b>5</b>

      and substitutes all symbols except           .'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: <style=title><color=#6be740><size=34>SCATTER</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "- <b><color=#fcd612>3 Scatters</color></b> anywhere on reels triggers\n
      \  <b><color=#fcd612>Lucky Arrows Free Games</color></b>.\n- <b><color=#fcd612>5
      Scatters</color></b> awards <b>25 Free Games</b>.\n- <b><color=#fcd612>4 Scatters</color></b>
      awards <b>15 Free Games</b>.\n- <b><color=#fcd612>3 Scatters</color></b> awards
      <b>12 Free Games</b>. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><color=#6be740><size=34>PROGRESSION FEATURE</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '- Plays both a High symbol and Progression symbol.

      - When on reels, each gets collected at the Progression Bar on top.

      - Once Progression Bar is full, <b><color=#fcd612>Lucky Arrow Super Free Games</color></b>
      is triggered.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=32>5 <color=#fcd612>{2:CommaNumber}</color>

      4 <color=#fcd612>{1:CommaNumber}</color>

      3 <color=#fcd612>{0:CommaNumber}</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <color=#6be740>{2:CommaNumber}</color>

      4 <color=#6be740>{1:CommaNumber}</color>

      3 <color=#6be740>{0:CommaNumber}</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_4
    value: <style=title><color=#6be740><size=34>LUCKY ARROWS FREE GAMES</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "- <b>3</b> or more Scatters anywhere on reels triggers <b>Lucky Arrows
      Free Games</b>.\n-           lands on the 1st reel only with a random number
      from <b>1</b> to <b>10</b>.\n-           lands on last reel only with a random
      number from <b>1</b> to <b>10</b>.\n- When both symbols appear at a spin and
      the number on           is <b>EQUAL</b> to or <b>HIGHER</b>\n   than the number
      on           , then the leftmost available chest on top gets rewarded.   "
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_5
    value: <style=title><color=#6be740><size=34>LUCKY ARROWS SUPER FREE GAMES</style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "- When Progression Bar is full, Lucky Arrows Super Free Games is triggered.\n-
      When triggered, Wheels of Fortune appear and reveal the number of arrays and
      spins\n   for Lucky Arrows Super Free Games (maximum 4 arrays)."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><color=#6be740><size=34>LINES</size></style></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_LINES
    value: <size=24>The 4 reel sets have the same pay lines.
